 "about": "Add a deck or cube to the collection (contract/list-to-collection-2026-10-22.md). Each line goes in as the printing, finish and language the list names (an entry's or op's lang defaults to en). Main and Commander always count; a deck's sideboard counts unless sideboard is false; Considering never does. 'missing' adds only what the collection lacks of each card (contract/owned-by-card-2026-10-31.md): copies of the printing + finish a line names over every condition and language (owned is keyed 'card_id|finish' for English copies or 'card_id|finish|lang'); owned copies cover lines in their own language first, then the others, English lines first, then by language code; then the card's other copies (another printing or finish; 'oracles' maps a printing to its card, a printing missing from it is its own card) cover what's left, lines by card_id, finish, then language as before; 'all' adds every copy listed. 'only' limits it to some printings (card detail). Ops come out sorted by card_id, then finish, then lang, and only with delta > 0. iOS ListToCollectionTests, web listToCollection.test.ts and Android ListToCollectionTest read this.",
